   $q$Which sentence should be removed because it interrupts the story?$q$, $q$[{"text":"sentence 12","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-character-reaction"},{"text":"sentence 5","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-problem"},{"text":"sentence 8","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-sensory-detail"},{"text":"sentence 10","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$sentence 10$q$, $q$Sentence 10 tells what the cafeteria serves on Fridays, which has nothing to do with the field trip. Sentence 5 must stay because it sets up the narrator's frustration before the discovery.$q$, 'draft', '7df4e7ef-6ff3-5bbd-b157-131f58bd7411')
