   $q$The writer wants to add one more detail from Arriaga's article to support sentence 11. Which detail would be most relevant?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The mesh used in the nets is woven from a material similar to the kind used in fishing nets.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-detail"},{"text":"The ridge where the nets stand is about six hundred meters above the level of the sea.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-detail"},{"text":"Parents who once walked to the stream now use those morning hours to tend vegetable plots and run small shops.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Scientists in other countries hope to test larger fog nets on their own hillsides someday.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"off-point-evidence"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Parents who once walked to the stream now use those morning hours to tend vegetable plots and run small shops.$q$, $q$Sentence 11 claims the nets give time back to families, and parents using freed hours for gardens and shops shows exactly that. The other countries detail is about future research, not about time saved in Las Brisas.$q$, 'draft', '2bfb5292-31b6-56a1-8b78-e11da4a5b6fe')
