   $q$Which sentence would best fill the blank in sentence 12 to conclude the draft?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Adeyemi's team showed ten Spanish cartoons to 120 ninth graders in the study.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"evidence-without-analysis"},{"text":"Captions are the only thing any student will ever need to learn a new language.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overgeneralization"},{"text":"Adeyemi's findings show that captions lead to higher quiz scores and longer memory, so they deserve a place in language classes.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Cartoons have been popular with young viewers for a very long time.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"off-topic-detail"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Adeyemi's findings show that captions lead to higher quiz scores and longer memory, so they deserve a place in language classes.$q$, $q$A strong conclusion restates the claim and connects it to the key results. The choice about captions being the only thing students need goes far beyond a study of vocabulary quizzes.$q$, 'draft', '11a69fea-2e57-5b33-a9bd-ba786f7c0aed')
