  ('814894bd-bbbd-5ea8-bfed-2fe56cd2e471', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g9-writing-with-evidence'), null, 'hard',
   $q$A peer reviewer says that sentence 9 is weaker evidence than sentence 5. Which explanation best supports this comment?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Sentence 9 appears later in the draft, so it must be less important than sentence 5.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"position-equals-importance"},{"text":"Sentence 9 disagrees with Adeyemi's main finding about how captions help students.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"false-contradiction"},{"text":"Sentence 9 is about a different language from the one studied in sentence 5.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-text"},{"text":"Sentence 9 reports what some students said they felt, while sentence 5 reports measured quiz scores for every student.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Sentence 9 reports what some students said they felt, while sentence 5 reports measured quiz scores for every student.$q$, $q$Measured results for all 120 students are stronger evidence than the opinions of some students. Sentence 9 does not disagree with the main finding; it supports it, just less strongly.$q$, 'draft', '11a69fea-2e57-5b33-a9bd-ba786f7c0aed')
