   $q$Which sentence would best fill the blank in sentence 8 to respond to the argument in sentence 7?$q$, $q$[{"text":"This is true, so the program should probably switch to video calls next year.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"concedes-claim"},{"text":"Video calls were invented many years after people first began writing letters.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-history"},{"text":"People who disagree with pen pal programs simply do not understand them.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"dismisses-counterclaim"},{"text":"However, Lindqvist's article suggests that letters offer some advantages that calls cannot.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$However, Lindqvist's article suggests that letters offer some advantages that calls cannot.$q$, $q$The correct choice answers the objection and leads into the evidence in sentences 9 and 10. The choice that says people simply do not understand dismisses the argument instead of answering it with evidence.$q$, 'draft', '0f289b91-dfa0-52ae-ad8d-faf331dc736f')
